msgid ""
"Marks this dashboard as protected: 'unlink' rejects deleting it (see "
"'_check_unlink_not_locked') and 'write' rejects changing its 'Code' while "
"this is set (see '_check_write_code_not_locked'). 'Name', items and layout "
"stay freely editable either way — locking protects this record's identity, "
"not its content. Set on this module's built-in 'My Dashboard' and on every "
"dashboard referenced by a 'dashboard.template' (see that model's "
"'source_dashboard_id' and '_lock_source_dashboard'). Never copied to a "
"duplicate of this dashboard ('copy=False') — a copy is a brand new record no"
" template points at yet, so it always starts unlocked. Never set through the"
" UI directly (read-only)."
msgstr ""

